      "description": "The mean inlet is (18 + 6) / 2 = 12 m³ per day, equal to U8 + D4. But wet18 = deliveries12 + onward6; dry6 = U6 + D0. Across both days 24 enters and only 18 reaches these users; the other 6 passes onward when they cannot store it. Needs across both days total 24, so 6 is unmet on the dry day. An aggregate balance across dates is not a delivery at the needed time.",
